{"title": "第三章", "index": 1415, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IAG9U0-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">不尚贤，使民不争；不贵难得之货，使民不为盗；不见可欲，使民心不乱。</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">是以圣人之治，虚其心，实其腹，弱其志，强其骨。常使民无知、无欲。使夫智者不敢为也，为无为，则无不治。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}